#: data/maps/Route117/scripts.inc:218
msgctxt "Route117_Text_DayCarePokemonHadNewMove"
msgid ""
"I left my POKéMON at the DAY CARE.\p"
"When I got it back, it had a new move\n"
"that I didn't teach it.\l"
"I was really, really surprised.$"
msgstr ""
"我把宝可梦寄放在寄放屋里。\p"
"领回来的时候，它学会了一个我没教过\n"
"的新招式。我真的、真的很惊讶。$"

#: data/maps/Route117/scripts.inc:224
msgctxt "Route117_Text_ArentTheseFlowersPretty"
msgid ""
"What do you think?\n"
"Aren't these flowers pretty?\p"
"I planted them all!$"
msgstr ""
"你觉得怎么样？这些花很漂亮吧？\p"
"全都是我种的哦！$"

#: data/maps/Route117/scripts.inc:229
msgctxt "Route117_Text_AirIsTastyHere"
msgid "The air is tasty here!$"
msgstr "这里的空气真好！$"

